menu "OpenClaw Native Node"

    config OPENCLAW_NODE_DEVICE_COMMANDS
        bool "Built-in board device commands"
        default y
        help
            Build the device command table that node.invoke.request dispatches
            to: screen, audio, backlight, button, file and Lua commands. It needs
            the board manager, the system UI and the capability framework.

            Disable this to build the transport on its own. The component's own
            on-target tests do that, so they can run without a board, a display
            or the audio stack. openclaw_node_device_commands() then reports an
            empty command list and every command answers ESP_ERR_NOT_SUPPORTED.

endmenu
